{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c8ff6ba3984bcb458bba97b2cc1d5b5c6728168eba5b04fe690737435f8d5476", "ja": "（ん？　……これは、ハンドベルの音か。\nもしかして……）", "zh": "（嗯……？这是手钟的声音吧。\n难道是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "5572f0f12fdf0382c4faddcd7bc3280fe887cfe3f4e6eea40bb157db93db59ac", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nもしかして、ベルの音、廊下まで聞こえてた？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n手钟的声音该不会传到走廊上了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1003_p", "source_sha256": "766bf571522193a3d3ec0f032913cfffe231cd84d43c6aad2e839f932aa2b4c2", "ja": "お疲れさま、育。ああ、聞こえてきたよ。\nずいぶん上手くなったみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，育。是啊，走廊也听得见喔。\n你好像进步了不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "5dbb7bc5104dca71a4e9e10db40e9c623fdac7f946ae8fafbd7c296e97fc5825", "ja": "でしょ！　桃子ちゃんと、もうとっくんしたんだから。\n本番までには、もっとうまくなるよ！", "zh": "对吧！因为我跟桃子特训过了嘛。\n等到正式演出那天，还会再更进步喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d9879ca04b7ebc01176cdfe9eb5939debba598943640e8b48fe904bff960d0e3", "ja": "そうか、本番が楽しみだな。\nでも今日はもう遅いから、帰ろうな。送るよ。", "zh": "这样啊，真令人期待正式演出。\n不过今天已经很晚了，快点回家吧，我送你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "bf40d26c888e56ed085c4b9307e348b0508c95933c6ca8dd23961821462df70d", "ja": "はーい！　えへへ……本番のステージ、\n楽しみにしててね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "好～！嘿嘿……你要好好期待正式演出喔，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0092_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "93db9b13bce873bcb64428661825545da4a65886f611d2662ca20eb9e3659e8f", "ja": "わたしと桃子ちゃんで、すごい演奏、\n聞かせてあげる！　約束だよ！", "zh": "我和桃子会让你听到很棒的演奏！\n一言为定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
